config BR2_PACKAGE_SAZ1051_VENDOR
	bool "saz1051-vendor (SAZ1051 board firmware blobs)"
	help
	  SAZ1051 (Hi3516CV610 + OS05L10 + WS73) closed vendor firmware.

	  Provides the bits OpenIPC's generic cv6xx package lacks for THIS
	  board: the OS05L10 sensor library + ini, the WS73 USB WiFi driver
	  and RF firmware, the board init (replaces stock /init), and the
	  majestic config. MPP userspace .so and the load_hisilicon script
	  come from the upstream hisilicon-osdrv-hi3516cv6xx package; the
	  prebuilt MPP kernel modules (open_*.ko, built CONFIG_PM=n) are
	  installed here into /lib/modules/5.10.221/hisilicon.

	  Sourced from the repo's vendor/saz1051/ directory.
